    "summary": {
        "en": [
            "Francis Bradley Bradley-Birt (1851-1921) was a British artist, author, and photographer. He is known for his travels in India and the Himalayas, where he documented the landscapes and cultures through his paintings and photographs. His works often reflect a blend of artistic expression and scientific observation, capturing the beauty and diversity of the regions he explored."
        ]
